<section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">LEARN WITH INTENTION</p><h1>学び方を整え、<br>昨日より一歩進む。</h1><p>勉強法、思考法、デジタル活用。知識を並べるだけでなく、今日から使える方法を丁寧に届けます。</p><a class="hero-link" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">記事を読む <span>↗</span></a></section><section class="section"><div class="section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">LATEST ARTICLES</p><h2>新着記事</h2></div><a href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">すべて見る →</a></div><div class="article-grid"><% page.posts.each(function(post){ %><article class="article-card"><a href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>"><div class="card-top"><span><%= post.categories && post.categories.length ? post.categories.first().name : 'ARTICLE' %></span><time><%= date(post.date,'YYYY.MM.DD') %></time></div><h3><%= post.title %></h3><p><%= post.description || strip_html(post.excerpt || post.content).slice(0,110) %></p><span class="read-more">続きを読む ↗</span></a></article><% }); %></div></section>
